                                "text": "кре́мовая бе́лка",
                                "translation": "cream-coloured/colored giant squirrel",
                                "english": "cream-coloured/colored giant squirrel"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1a812c4-1f50-4c67-b223-b87c375ef93e",
                                "sense_id": "6ac82f3d-2f81-3523-bb46-de5d666979a1",
                                "text": "Дня че́рез два в кварти́ре появи́лась ху́денькая с подрисо́ванными глаза́ми ба́рышня в кре́мовых чуло́чках и о́чень смути́лась при ви́де великоле́пия кварти́ры.",
                                "translation": "Two days later a thin young girl in cream-coloured stockings with heavily made-up eyes appeared and was clearly overwhelmed at the sight of the splendid flat.",
                                "english": "Two days later a thin young girl in cream-coloured stockings with heavily made-up eyes appeared and was clearly overwhelmed at the sight of the splendid flat."
